  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Match List-I with List-II.</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List-I</strong></p>\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Element detected</strong></p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List-II</strong></p>\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Reagent used/Product formed</strong></p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Nitrogen</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Na</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>Fe</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>CN</mi></mfenced><mn>5</mn></msub><mi>NO</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Sulphur</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>II</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>AgNO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Phosphorus</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>III</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Fe</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>Fe</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>CN</mi></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msub></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Halogen</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>IV</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>MoO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below:</p>"
